be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.517 --> 00:29.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants.
全部：
海绵宝宝。

00:29.482 --> 00:31.379
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.413
all: SpongeBob SquarePants.
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝。
- 准备好？

00:33.482 --> 00:35.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants.
全部：
海绵宝宝。

00:35.344 --> 00:37.413
SpongeBob SquarePants.
海绵宝宝。

00:37.482 --> 00:39.517
SpongeBob SquarePants.
海绵宝宝。

00:39.586 --> 00:40.862
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.931 --> 00:42.724
SquarePants.
方裤。

00:42.793 --> 00:45.448
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.517 --> 00:47.758
