♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.827 --> 00:49.586
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.127 --> 00:53.989
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:54.058 --> 01:01.300
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:02.162 --> 01:04.368
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

01:04.437 --> 01:05.610
Where's that bus?
那辆公共汽车在哪里？

01:05.679 --> 01:08.127
I've been waiting for
almost an hour.
我一直在等待
差不多一个小时。

01:08.196 --> 01:12.058
- Heh. Almost an hour he says.
- 呵呵。他说差不多一个小时了。

01:18.437 --> 01:19.644
- Hmm.
- 唔。

01:19.713 --> 01:22.644
Late again.
又迟到了。

01:22.713 --> 01:23.989
One coin.
一枚硬币。

01:24.058 --> 01:25.955
Exact change.
- Aha.
确切的改变。
- 啊哈。

01:26.024 --> 01:28.162
- Exactly.
- 确切地。

01:28.231 --> 01:30.920
Late.
晚的。

01:30.989 --> 01:33.575
- Oh, brother.
- 哦，兄弟。

01:36.231 --> 01:37.989
- Will you please watch
your speed?
- 请你看一下好吗
你的速度？

01:38.058 --> 01:39.955
And stay in the lane.
并留在车道上。

01:40.024 --> 01:41.817
When was the last time you
cleaned this bus?
上次你是什么时候
清理了这辆公共汽车吗？

01:41.886 --> 01:43.610
[sniffing]
Ew, it smells like
[嗅嗅]
呃，闻起来像

01:43.679 --> 01:45.231
a narwhal's armpit in here.
这里有独角鲸的腋窝。

01:45.300 --> 01:46.989
- All right, that's it.
- 好吧，就是这样。

01:47.886 --> 01:49.644
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:49.713 --> 01:51.368
- Krusty Krab.
- 蟹堡王。

01:51.437 --> 01:53.851
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:53.920 --> 01:55.679
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

01:55.748 --> 01:57.127
You big clod.
你这个大土包。

01:57.196 --> 02:00.506
I could do your job better than
you ever could.
我可以比你做得更好
你曾经可以。

02:00.575 --> 02:04.920
- Yeah? Well, I could do your
job better than you ever could.
- 是的？好吧，我可以做你的
工作比你以前能做的更好。

02:04.989 --> 02:06.024
What's his job?
他的工作是什么？

02:06.093 --> 02:09.162
- Oh, he's a terrible cashier.
- 哦，他是个糟糕的收银员。

02:09.231 --> 02:11.817
- That I could do.
- 我能做到的。

02:11.886 --> 02:12.817
- All right, all right.
- 好吧，好吧。

02:12.886 --> 02:14.231
Jumpin' jelly fish.
跳跃的水母。

02:14.300 --> 02:16.817
I'm tired of you two
bickering every morning.
我厌倦了你们两个
每天早上都吵架。

02:16.886 --> 02:18.472
I say prove it.
我说证明一下。

02:18.541 --> 02:21.817
Switch jobs right now and
settle it once and for all.
立即换工作并
一劳永逸地解决它。

02:21.886 --> 02:24.437
- I'll take that challenge.
- 我会接受这个挑战。

02:24.506 --> 02:26.024
- You better get going, driver.
- 你最好走吧，司机。

02:26.093 --> 02:27.989
You're already behind schedule.
你已经落后于计划了。

02:28.058 --> 02:31.713
[both grumbling]
[两人都抱怨]

02:31.782 --> 02:32.782
- Hmm.
- 唔。

02:32.851 --> 02:34.920
Ahh.
啊。

02:34.989 --> 02:38.334
[groaning]
[呻吟]

02:38.403 --> 02:39.575
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:39.644 --> 02:41.989
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

02:42.058 --> 02:46.265
all: Whoa-oh! Whoa-oh!
全体：哇哦！哇哦！

02:46.334 --> 02:48.920
- ♪ La-da-dee la-dah-dah ♪
- ♪ 拉达迪拉达达 ♪

02:48.989 --> 02:51.472
Oh, I like this.
哦，我喜欢这个。

02:54.472 --> 02:56.058
Good morning.
早上好。

02:56.127 --> 02:58.748
- It's afternoon already,
clown.
- 已经是下午了
小丑。

02:58.817 --> 03:00.920
Eh, ah-ah.
呃，啊啊。

03:00.989 --> 03:03.541
No sharp objects allowed.
不允许使用尖锐物体。

03:04.748 --> 03:07.886
- [munching]
- Huh?
- [咀嚼]
- 啊？

03:07.955 --> 03:11.886
Attention: this is your
cheerful driver speaking.
注意：这是你的
开朗的司机说话。

03:11.955 --> 03:14.024
There'll be no eating or
drinking
不会有东西吃或者
饮酒

03:14.093 --> 03:17.506
aboard my happy bus...
登上我快乐的巴士...

03:17.575 --> 03:18.403
- Ohh.
- 哦。

03:18.472 --> 03:21.679
Especially Krabby Patties.
尤其是蟹肉饼。

03:24.541 --> 03:27.196
This stop is Coral Boulevard.
这一站是珊瑚大道。

03:27.265 --> 03:29.989
Thank you for riding with your
merry bus driver.
感谢您与您一起骑行
快乐的巴士司机。

03:30.058 --> 03:32.437
And have
a beautiful da--hey.
并且有
一个美丽的达——嘿。

03:32.506 --> 03:34.506
- Squidward.
- 章鱼哥。

03:34.575 --> 03:37.437
- No!
- 不！

03:37.506 --> 03:40.024
- It's you.
- 是你。

03:40.093 --> 03:41.403
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

03:41.472 --> 03:43.644
- I've always dreamed one day
I'd board a bus
- 我一直梦想着有一天
我会搭巴士

03:43.713 --> 03:45.437
and see you driving it.
看看你驾驶它。

03:45.506 --> 03:47.644
- Why am I in that dream?
- 为什么我会在那个梦里？

03:47.713 --> 03:50.472
- Oh, Squidward, you're in all
my dreams.
-哦，章鱼哥，你就是一切
我的梦想。

03:50.541 --> 03:52.989
- Get off me and pay your fare.
- 下车并付车费。

03:53.058 --> 03:55.886
And you'd better have--huh?
你最好——嗯？

03:55.955 --> 03:58.231
- Exact change. Exactly.
- 确切的改变。确切地。

03:58.300 --> 04:02.368
Clink, clink, clink, clink,
叮当，叮当，叮当，叮当，

04:02.437 --> 04:06.575
clink, clink, clink, clink.
叮当，叮当，叮当，叮当。

04:06.644 --> 04:09.679
- Augh! Enough with the
pennies!
- 啊啊！够了
便士！

04:09.748 --> 04:13.403
- Clink, clink, clink, clink,
clink, clink.
- 叮当，叮当，叮当，叮当，
叮当，叮当。

04:13.472 --> 04:14.506
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

04:14.575 --> 04:15.575
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

04:15.644 --> 04:17.644
- [grumbling]
- Hey, Squidward.
- [抱怨]
- 嘿，章鱼哥。

04:17.713 --> 04:19.300
Hey, Squidward.
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。
嘿，章鱼哥。

04:19.368 --> 04:20.817
Hey, Squidward.
- What?
嘿，章鱼哥。
- 什么？

04:20.886 --> 04:22.817
- I'm helping you drive.
- 我帮你开车。

04:22.886 --> 04:23.920
- No, you're not.
- 不，你不是。

04:23.989 --> 04:25.127
- Time to switch lanes.
- 是时候换道了。

04:25.196 --> 04:26.955
Better use my signal.
最好用我的信号。

04:27.024 --> 04:30.058
[clicking tongue]
[咂舌]

04:30.127 --> 04:33.989
- Oh, oh, oh, oh-ah, ah!
- 哦，哦，哦，哦，啊，啊！

04:34.058 --> 04:36.920
Ahh!
啊！

04:36.989 --> 04:40.403
Don't help me drive!
别帮我开车！

04:40.472 --> 04:41.265
- Okay.
- 好的。

04:41.334 --> 04:42.955
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

04:43.024 --> 04:45.748
Wow.
- Ahh, eh eh, eh.
哇。
- 啊，呃呃，呃。

04:45.817 --> 04:47.851
Whew.
呼。

04:47.920 --> 04:49.679
Oh, what am I doing?
哦，我在做什么？

04:49.748 --> 04:51.610
Sit in the back.
坐在后面。

04:51.679 --> 04:54.679
- Okay.
- 好的。

04:54.748 --> 04:57.679
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

05:00.472 --> 05:02.162
- What--what the...
- 什么--什么...

05:03.886 --> 05:05.679
[sighs]
Ahh!
[叹气]
啊！

05:05.748 --> 05:10.817
- Objects in mirror are closer
than they appear.
- 镜子中的物体更近
比他们出现的要多。

05:10.886 --> 05:12.955
Aw, let me help.
噢，让我帮忙。

05:13.024 --> 05:16.196
This is for softer braking.
这是为了更柔和的制动。

05:16.265 --> 05:18.575
- Augh,
the brakes don't work.
- 噢，
刹车不起作用。

05:20.851 --> 05:22.541
Ahh-ahh!
啊啊啊！

05:22.610 --> 05:24.127
Augh!
啊啊！

05:24.196 --> 05:26.058
[engine revving]
[发动机转速]

05:26.127 --> 05:28.265
Argh!
啊！

05:28.334 --> 05:31.196
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

05:31.265 --> 05:32.196
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:32.265 --> 05:36.851
- Mmph! Huh? Argh.
- 嗯！啊？啊。

05:36.920 --> 05:38.851
Argh!
- Oh!
啊！
- 哦！

05:38.920 --> 05:40.058
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:40.127 --> 05:43.679
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

05:43.748 --> 05:45.437
- SpongeBob, what is
your stop,
- 海绵宝宝，什么是
你的停靠站，

05:45.506 --> 05:47.851
so I can take you there right
now?
这样我就可以带你去那里
现在？

05:47.920 --> 05:49.162
- Oh, I don't have a stop.
- 哦，我没有停下来。

05:49.231 --> 05:50.679
Today is my bus riding day,
今天是我搭巴士的日子

05:50.748 --> 05:55.300
the day I just pick a bus and
ride it all day.
那天我刚选了一辆公共汽车
骑它一整天。

05:55.368 --> 05:57.472
- There's only one
thing I can think of
- 只有一个
我能想到的事

05:57.541 --> 05:59.610
that could be worse.
那可能会更糟。

05:59.679 --> 06:00.610
Ahhhh!
啊啊啊！

06:00.679 --> 06:02.403
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

06:02.472 --> 06:04.851
- Augh! And that's it!
- 啊啊！就是这样！

06:04.920 --> 06:06.713
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

06:06.782 --> 06:09.851
[babbling]
[胡说]

06:09.920 --> 06:13.196
- Phew. I dodged that one.
Heh-heh.
- 唷。我躲开了那个。
呵呵。

06:13.265 --> 06:14.782
Augh!
啊啊！

06:14.851 --> 06:16.713
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

06:16.782 --> 06:18.265
Ehh-ehh-ehh.
呃呃呃。

06:18.334 --> 06:20.300
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

06:21.403 --> 06:24.437
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

06:24.506 --> 06:26.196
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

06:26.265 --> 06:28.231
- Phew. That was close.
- 唷。那很接近了。

06:28.300 --> 06:29.368
- It sure was.
- 确实如此。

06:29.437 --> 06:32.713
I almost didn't catch this bus.
我差点没赶上这趟公共汽车。

06:32.782 --> 06:35.851
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

06:35.920 --> 06:39.368
- Eeeee...Patrick. Wow.
- 呃…帕特里克。哇。

06:39.437 --> 06:40.713
We're both on the
same bus on our
我们都在
我们的同一辆巴士

06:40.782 --> 06:42.679
Just Riding Around
On The Bus Day.
只是骑车到处走走
在巴士日。

06:42.748 --> 06:45.851
What are the odds?
几率有多大？

06:45.920 --> 06:48.058
[both chuckling]
[两人都笑了]

06:48.127 --> 06:50.196
- Yes, what are the odds?
- 是的，可能性有多大？

06:50.265 --> 06:52.472
- I got my bus money
somewhere.
- 我拿到了公交车钱
某处。

06:52.541 --> 06:54.093
- Oh.
- Oh, there it is.
- 哦。
- 哦，就在那里。

06:54.162 --> 06:57.817
Huh, I think I left my
wallet in my other wallet.
呵呵，我想我离开了我的
钱包在我的另一个钱包里。

06:57.886 --> 06:58.955
- Don't worry, buddy.
-别担心，伙计。

06:59.024 --> 07:02.265
I've got exact change.
我有零钱。

07:02.334 --> 07:04.955
- One...
- 一...

07:05.024 --> 07:07.024
Two...
- [groaning]
两个...
- [呻吟]

07:07.093 --> 07:10.575
- Three.
- 三。

07:10.644 --> 07:11.955
- ♪ Dah-dah-dah-dum ♪
- ♪ 哒哒哒哒 ♪

07:12.024 --> 07:13.920
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:13.989 --> 07:14.989
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

07:15.058 --> 07:16.748
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

07:16.817 --> 07:18.265
- You hooligans.
- 你们这些流氓。

07:18.334 --> 07:20.920
- Ugh! Augh!
- 呃！啊啊！

07:20.989 --> 07:22.437
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

07:22.506 --> 07:25.506
[explosions]
[爆炸]

07:25.575 --> 07:27.748
- And now SpongeBob
will attempt to catch
- 现在是海绵宝宝
会尝试抓住

07:27.817 --> 07:29.748
his high-flying partner
Patrick
他的雄心勃勃的伙伴
帕特里克

07:29.817 --> 07:32.782
while swinging from the
strap of death.
当从
死亡带。

07:32.851 --> 07:34.300
- Hey-oh!
- 嘿-哦！

07:34.368 --> 07:36.679
[together]
Whoo. Whoa.
[一起]
呼。哇哦。

07:36.748 --> 07:39.403
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:39.472 --> 07:41.955
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

07:42.024 --> 07:44.300
- Ooh...oof!
- 哦...哦！

07:44.368 --> 07:46.851
- Awwww. Ohh, yes.
- 哇哦。哦，是的。

07:46.920 --> 07:49.610
- Lady, get that horrible
thing off your lap.
- 女士，变得太可怕了
东西离开你的腿。

07:49.679 --> 07:52.231
- I'll do no such thing.
- 我不会做这样的事。

07:52.300 --> 07:55.920
He's my emotional support
animal.
他是我情感上的依靠
动物。

07:55.989 --> 07:58.851
Oh, yes, aren't you?
哦，是的，你不是吗？

07:58.920 --> 08:03.058
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

08:03.127 --> 08:04.334
[barking]
[叫声]

08:04.403 --> 08:05.368
- Ohh.
- 哦。

08:05.437 --> 08:07.024
- [snarling]
- [咆哮]

08:07.093 --> 08:08.575
Rah!
啊！

08:08.644 --> 08:12.541
[both snarling and barking]
[咆哮和吠叫]

08:12.610 --> 08:13.610
- My leg! Oh!
- 我的腿！哦！

08:13.679 --> 08:17.265
[both snarling and barking]
[咆哮和吠叫]

08:17.334 --> 08:21.058
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

08:21.127 --> 08:22.851
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

08:24.058 --> 08:26.196
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

08:26.265 --> 08:28.162
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

08:28.231 --> 08:29.368
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

08:29.437 --> 08:30.713
That's it!
就是这样！

08:30.782 --> 08:33.403
I am throwing you two off right
now.
我要把你们两个扔掉
现在。

08:33.472 --> 08:35.368
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

08:35.437 --> 08:37.334
Where's that pink pinhead?
那个粉红色的针头在哪里？

08:37.403 --> 08:39.196
- Oh, he's in the restroom.
- Huh?
- 哦，他在洗手间里。
- 啊？

08:39.265 --> 08:40.920
That's not a restroom.
那不是卫生间。

08:40.989 --> 08:42.541
It's the emergency exit.
这是紧急出口。

08:42.610 --> 08:44.679
[toilet flushing]
[冲厕所]

08:44.748 --> 08:46.300
Augh!
啊啊！

08:46.368 --> 08:48.713
- You're out of toilet paper.
- 你的卫生纸用完了。

08:48.782 --> 08:50.920
Who's driving?
Well, I am, of course.
谁在开车？
嗯，我当然是。

08:50.989 --> 08:52.127
Wah!
哇！

08:52.196 --> 08:55.162
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

08:55.231 --> 08:58.644
all: Ahh!
全体：啊！

09:08.472 --> 09:10.748
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:12.058 --> 09:15.506
- This bus isn't designed for
the pressure at these depths.
- 这辆巴士不是为
这些深度的压力。

09:17.541 --> 09:18.989
- Ohh!
- Ahh!
- 哦！
- 啊！

09:19.058 --> 09:23.851
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:30.093 --> 09:31.817
- Aw, look at you.
- 噢，看看你。

09:31.886 --> 09:33.093
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

09:33.162 --> 09:34.472
Look at you.
看看你。

09:34.541 --> 09:38.403
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:41.437 --> 09:44.058
- We're gonna be crushed
to death.
- 我们会被压垮
至死。

09:44.127 --> 09:48.403
I don't wanna drive a bus.
我不想开公共汽车。

09:48.472 --> 09:50.334
- I don't wanna be crushed.
- 我不想被压垮。

09:50.403 --> 09:54.231
- I don't wanna eat
this sandwich.
-我不想吃饭
这个三明治。

09:54.300 --> 09:58.162
Ooh, a panini, so
very continental.
哦，帕尼尼，所以
非常欧陆式。

09:58.231 --> 10:00.093
[munching]
[咀嚼]

10:02.748 --> 10:06.093
- Hey, look, a passenger. Hi.
- 嘿，看，一位乘客。你好。

10:07.472 --> 10:10.575
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

10:10.644 --> 10:11.575
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:11.644 --> 10:13.679
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

10:13.748 --> 10:16.851
- I don't know where we're
going.
- 我不知道我们在哪里
去。

10:16.920 --> 10:19.920
- Don't worry. I have a bus
map.
- 不用担心。我有一辆公共汽车
地图。

10:22.644 --> 10:24.644
Take a left. Take another left.
向左转。再左转。

10:24.713 --> 10:27.058
Left. Left. Left.
左边。左边。左边。

10:27.127 --> 10:28.955
Left. Left, left, left.
- I can't see.
左边。左，左，左。
- 我看不到。

10:29.024 --> 10:31.058
- We don't need to see.
- 我们不需要看到。

10:31.127 --> 10:33.093
We just need to believe.
我们只需要相信。

10:33.162 --> 10:36.024
- I believe your map
is upside down.
- 我相信你的地图
是颠倒的。

10:36.093 --> 10:37.472
- Oh, I can fix that.
- 哦，我可以解决这个问题。

10:42.196 --> 10:43.920
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

10:43.989 --> 10:46.506
Ahh!
啊！

10:46.575 --> 10:48.093
- Back of the line, people.
- 队伍后面的人。

10:48.162 --> 10:49.541
Back of the line.
排在后面。

10:49.610 --> 10:51.989
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

10:52.058 --> 10:55.024
- Ohh.
Exact change only, please.
- 哦。
请仅进行精确更改。

10:55.093 --> 10:57.196
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

10:59.748 --> 11:01.058
Huh?
啊？

11:01.127 --> 11:02.610
all: Ugh!
全体：呃！

11:02.679 --> 11:05.162
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

11:05.231 --> 11:06.575
That settles it.
这样就解决了。

11:06.644 --> 11:08.851
I quit everything.
我放弃了一切。

11:08.920 --> 11:11.093
- Huh?
- 啊？

11:12.162 --> 11:14.093
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

11:14.162 --> 11:17.679
- The Krusty Krab Local right
on time.
- Krusty Krab 当地权利
准时。

11:17.748 --> 11:19.506
One Krabby Patty, please.
请来一份蟹肉饼。

11:19.575 --> 11:22.472
- One Krabby Patty?
- 一份蟹肉饼？

11:22.541 --> 11:26.024
Yes, sir. One Krabby Patty.
是的，先生。一份蟹肉饼。

11:27.024 --> 11:29.265
- One Krabby Patty coming up.
- 一只蟹肉饼即将上来。

11:29.334 --> 11:32.610
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

11:32.679 --> 11:34.748
- Place your orders, everybody.
- 大家下订单吧。

11:34.817 --> 11:38.403
Because no one can do this job
better than me.
因为没有人能胜任这项工作
比我好。

11:38.472 --> 11:40.231
I win.
我赢了。

11:40.300 --> 11:41.265
[toilet flushing]
[冲厕所]

11:41.334 --> 11:42.541
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

11:45.265 --> 11:49.472
- You're still out of
toilet paper.
- 你还没出局
卫生纸。

- 你还没出局
卫生纸。